  "note": "The built core combines this repository's integration (GPL-2.0, as SRB2: the driver, the platform layer, the mixer, the patches) with SRB2 Legacy (GPL-2.0, srb2-preservation's fork of Sonic Robo Blast 2 2.1), compiled in from the submodule extern/SRB2 with zlib and libpng from its own libs/, libogg and libvorbis (BSD-3-Clause), Game_Music_Emu (LGPL-2.1-or-later), libopenmpt (BSD-3-Clause), the parts of libOPNMIDI the core's own MIDI player (platform/midi_fm.cpp, GPL-2.0) is built on - its MIDI sequencer, WOPN bank loader, XG bank and volume and frequency models (MIT), its chip interface (LGPL-2.1-or-later) and MAME's YM2612 (GPL-2.0-or-later); libOPNMIDI's own player, GPL-3.0-or-later, is not built - Mesa's GL/gl.h (MIT, waterbox/compat/GL) for the OpenGL renderer's declarations, glad 2.0.5's generated GL declarations (public domain, with the Khronos data under Apache-2.0) for the GPU bridge's guest half, and miniBox's guest kit (musl, MIT; emulibc and libco's backend, MIT/public domain) with GCC's libstdc++ (GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception). The package carries none of the game's data: srb2.srb, zones.dta, player.dta, rings.dta, patch.dta, music.dta and legacy.pk3 are the user's firmware. Sonic the Hedgehog and related characters are trademarks of SEGA.",
